Data Source

The dataset used in this project was downloaded from the NCBI GEO database:

Accession: Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO) GSE301130
File used: GSE301130_c142_2wk_combinedReps_DELLY.vcf.gz
Source link: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE301130

This file contains structural variant calls generated using DELLY.
